# 基本文章編集から文字をウインドウの外へ運んで離す (design 11.3) のを、デスクトップの文章編集と
# プロセスの文章編集で同じにする, for tools/ui_run.py. A document of one line, made here and
# opened as 受け先 with no object behind it, is moved by its name band to the right of the
# screen, out of the way. A copy of 基本文章編集 with 30 paragraphs (mkbig doc 30) is opened
# at 100,100 (600 by 400), the letters of the second line of its second paragraph picked by carrying the hand across
# them, and carried by the hand out of the window onto 受け先: the desktop's text editor moves
# them there itself; the process hands them to the desktop as the hand leaves its window
# (DT_RQ_CARRY with DT_F_TEXT), which puts them in 受け先, and takes them out of its text.
# Saved, record 0 of the copy is the same, byte for byte, whichever editor carried them out;
# the shots (doc_drop_k_*, doc_drop_p_*) are compared afterwards inside the copy's window
# (101,125 to 682,482). The keys went to 受け先 with the letters: a press on the copy's name band
# gives them back before it is saved.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>受け先の行</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlopen 受け先
wait 500
drag 300 75 1000 395
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
drag 160 230 420 230
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_drop_k_picked
hold 300 230
wait 100
move 400 240
wait 100
move 600 300
wait 100
move 800 420
wait 1000
move 900 450
wait 1000
up
sync 600
wait 300
click 400 112
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_drop_k_done
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
drag 160 230 420 230
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_drop_p_picked
logmark
hold 300 230
wait 100
move 400 240
wait 100
move 600 300
wait 100
move 800 420
expectsince document: left the window carrying
wait 1000
move 900 450
wait 1000
up
expectsince document: letters carried out (0)
wait 300
logmark
click 400 112
wait 300
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_drop_p_done
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
